>In an encounter, if you don't Command your familiar, it still gains 1 action each round. Typically, you still decide how it spends that action, but, the GM might determine that your familiar chooses its own tactics rather than performing your preferred action. This doesn't work with @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.familiar-abilities.Item.9PsptrEoCC4QdM23]{Valet} or similar abilities that require a command, if you're capable of riding your familiar, or similar situations.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":""},"rules":[],"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"independent","_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.367","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.4.1","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.familiar-abilities.Item.2fiQzoEKu6YUnrU9","createdTime":1788393106915,"modifiedTime":1788393106925,"lastModifiedBy":"mUD3U8RxGIcb63MK","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"mUD3U8RxGIcb63MK":3},"flags":{"pf2e":{"grantedBy":{"id":"xrawJrEdbne2OIty","onDelete":"cascade"}}},"_id":"3zOgUwIVhxlJPHGn"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Speech","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"familiar","description":{"value":"<p>It understands and speaks a language you know.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":""},"rules":[],"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"speech","_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.367","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.4.1","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.familiar-abilities.Item.zyMRLQnFCQVpltiR","createdTime":1788393106917,"modifiedTime":1788393106926,"lastModifiedBy":"mUD3U8RxGIcb63MK","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"mUD3U8RxGIcb63MK":3},"flags":{"pf2e":{"grantedBy":{"id":"xrawJrEdbne2OIty","onDelete":"cascade"}}},"_id":"ZZ7prgBjzkJuQRmv"},{"name":"Gibe","type":"action","effects":[],"system":{"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":{"schema":0.935,"foundry":"14.367","system":"8.4.1"}},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p><hr><p><strong>Effect</strong> The mockingfey takes on the imperfect, illusory appearance of a creature it can see within 60 feet, pantomiming the mannerisms in a derisive fashion. This illusion doesn't make the mockingfey look any larger and lasts until the end of your next turn.<br>The creature must attempt a @Check[type:will|dc:resolve(@actor.master.attributes.classOrSpellDC.value)] save against your class DC or spell DC, whichever is the higher. Regardless of the result, the creature is immune for 1 minute.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{off-guard} until the start of your next turn, as it's distracted by your familiar's taunts.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is off-guard until the end of your next turn</p><p></p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Lost Omens Rival Academies 45","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"rules":[],"slug":"gibe","traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","illusion","mental","occult","visual"]},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"familiar","deathNote":false,"frequency":{"max":1,"per":"round","value":1}},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","folder":null,"ownership":{"default":0,"mUD3U8RxGIcb63MK":3},"flags":{"pf2e":{"grantedBy":{"id":"xrawJrEdbne2OIty","onDelete":"cascade"}}},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e-specific-familiars.specific-familiars-actions.Item.yhxOhLAyefQq8g1f","duplicateSource":null,"coreVersion":"14.367","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.4.1","